error[E0160]: u.Find("ann") returns (User, bool); markup takes one value, unwrapping only a call returning (T, error)
  --> err_unwrap.vuka:16:7
   |
16 |         <p>{u.Find("ann")}</p>
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: call a method returning one value, or set a field in Load or Mount and show the field

